    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "Hunter-gatherers travelled from place-to-place in search of plant and animal resources when had exhausted at one place. They also moved in search of smaller prey, followed the movements of deer and wild cattle, and sought different kinds of plants in different seasons. Today, we do not travel for water and food but in search of jobs, interesting places, business, and to meet friends and relatives.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
